# Node ESM build/tooling scripts (run with bare `node`, not part of the RN app
# bundle). They use import.meta / top-level await which the @react-native ESLint
# parser does not accept; they are typechecked-out via `// @ts-nocheck`.
# Scoped to .mjs only so future real scripts (.ts/.js) are still linted.
scripts/**/*.mjs
